/* Hea011: GEOMETRIC_SET compound mixing three defect classes: (a) sub-tolerance EDGE_CURVE 1e-7 long between near-coincident VERTEX_POINTs; (b) OPEN_SHELL with one 1x1 rectangular ADVANCED_FACE on PLANE; (c) EDGE_CURVE with 3D LINE length=1.0 but pcurve LINE length=5.0 (same-param violation); ShapeProcess driver must chain fix-shape + same-parameter + remove-small-edges */
